{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1pYJjG7Gs3pcG4q2KxH", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I filed one bug and signed off with low confidence (0.5), because I skipped several things in the sweep.\n\n**Bug filed (confirmed by the developer):** with \"Folder first\" unchecked in the sort dialog, the Zeta folder still sits at the top of the list. Sorted by name ascending, it should come after todo.txt. This matches the change to the directory grouping pass.\n\n**Checked and working:**\n- **Search and replace:** a regex replace-all with a `$1` capture group changed both matches in Regex2.md, and undo restored the original text.\n- **Duplicate line:** it worked on the last line of Single.md, which has no trailing newline. It also worked on the first line of Indent.md, and undo reverted it.\n- **View mode:** nested lists, `$` amounts (Money.md), a heading with bullets (Shopping.md) and nested lists in Indent2.md all rendered correctly. Money.md also rendered correctly after rotating to landscape and back.\n- **Name sort and reverse:** both ordered the files consistently. I did not log a bug for Indent2.md appearing before Indent.md (and Regex2.md before Regex.md) in plain name order, because I wasn't sure what order the app is meant to use.\n\n**Not tested:** sorting by Date, Size or MIME type, file-browser search, and the Notes.md and todo.txt files.\n\nI did change some files while testing. Duplicating the line in Single.md was autosaved, so it now contains \"gamma\" twice. Indent.md, Money.md and Regex2.md were edited and the changes undone before I left them."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 330, "cache_read_input_tokens": 95304, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 330}, "output_tokens": 520, "service_tier": "standard", "in